1
00:00:00,675 --> 00:00:02,742
Every time you click a link,

2
00:00:02,762 --> 00:00:04,775
a tiny message races across

3
00:00:04,775 --> 00:00:05,837
the world and back in

4
00:00:05,837 --> 00:00:07,650
a fraction of a second.

5
00:00:09,433 --> 00:00:10,858
Let's follow it.

6
00:00:12,508 --> 00:00:14,483
Your browser asks DNS

7
00:00:14,483 --> 00:00:15,651
for the address,

8
00:00:15,671 --> 00:00:17,775
sends the request to a server,

9
00:00:17,795 --> 00:00:19,096
and the server fetches your

10
00:00:19,096 --> 00:00:21,058
data from a database.

11
00:00:22,683 --> 00:00:23,851
And with caching,

12
00:00:23,871 --> 00:00:26,050
each repeat visit gets faster,

13
00:00:26,070 --> 00:00:28,658
dropping below the one second mark.
